# The compact board with the 3D view's tool groups docked elsewhere: the
# camera column lying flat at the bottom left, the chips standing upright
# on the right edge, the scene menu at the bottom right and the motion
# slider at the top left.
view centre 0 0 0
code centre 0 0 1
parts start 0 0 0
files start 0 1 0
details end 0 0 0
edit end 0 0 1
problems bottom 0 0 0
output bottom 0 0 1
show start true
show end true
show top false
show bottom false
tool camera bottom-left
tool moves right
tool scene bottom-right
tool motion top-left
